<title>THAILAND: BMW sees strong 1996 profit and sales.</title>
<headline>BMW sees strong 1996 profit and sales.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Motoren Werke AG (BMW) chairman and chief executive officer, Bernd Pischetsrieder, said on Thursday he believed it was fair to expect the company to report a 10 percent profit growth and 4.0 percent increase in sales in 1996.</p>
